      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "This subclass includes:\n- veneer sheets whose face veneer has an attractive appearance due to figure, colour, grain, lustre, etc. made of nonconiferous wood other than tropical. The sheets for veneering of fine highly grained woods used in cabinet making veneers are more often obtained by sawing or slicing. They are often used for the cores of plywood.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "本子类包括：\n- 由除热带木材以外的阔叶木制成的单板，其表层单板因花纹、颜色、纹理、光泽等而具有美观外观。用于制作家具贴面用的、纹理精细的优质木材单板，多通过锯切或旋切获得。它们常用于胶合板芯板。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
